    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is given as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>133</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>133</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>255</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>255</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>122</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>61</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>38</mn></math></p><p>Number of divisors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>38</mn></math>&nbsp;and their sum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn></math></p>"
